      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.18,
      "end_seconds": 343.29,
      "duration_seconds": 23.11,
      "text": "Let's use benzoyl peroxide gel, 5%, once a day, eight weeks. That's for acne. Wash gently twice a day and don't squeeze the spots. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. I'd like you back in eight weeks."
